  <activity label="str-ex-eggs" xml:id="str-ex-eggs">
    <statement>
      <p>Write code to evaluate the length of the string <q>I like green eggs</q> and print it. It should print <q>The length is 17</q>.</p>
    </statement>
    <program interactive="activecode" language="python">
      <code>

      </code>
    </program>
    <solution>
       <p>Write code to evaluate the length of the string <q>I like green eggs</q> and print it. It should print <q>The length is 17</q>.</p>
       <program xml:id="str-ex-eggsacq-sol" interactive="activecode" language="python">
        <code>
sentence = "I like green eggs"
print("The length is " + str(len(sentence)))
        </code>
       </program>
    </solution>
  </activity>


